        "original_id": "d518389a-4204-50f5-b276-954077495cf4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Graham, Shane Meadows\n- Works: Snatch, This Is England, This Is England '86, This Is England '88, This Is England '90, Public Enemies, Pirates of the Caribbean, Boardwalk Empire\n- Roles: Tommy, Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne, Baby Face Nelson, Scrum, Al Capone\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Graham was born on 3 August 1973 and is an English film and television actor.\n- Stephen Graham played Tommy in the film Snatch, which was released in 2000.\n- This Is England is a 2006 British drama film written and directed by Shane Meadows.\n- Stephen Graham played Andrew \"Combo\" Gascoigne in This Is England and in its television sequels This Is England '86, This Is England '88, and This Is England '90.\n- Stephen Graham played Baby Face Nelson in Public Enemies, which was released in 2009.\n- Stephen Graham played Scrum in the Pirates of the Caribbean films.\n- Stephen Graham played Al Capone in the HBO series Boardwalk Empire.",
